[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-ms[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Record Card: an editable value sheet under the H1 of every record [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]note[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Every healthy record note shows its album-defined fields as a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]quiet, beautiful record sheet under the H1 and above ## Notes, in [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]bob's vocabulary. Every value is editable from a keyboard-first [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Record Card (== , Ctrl+Shift+P, palette, Command Mode, or a click) [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]through one guarded bob writer, with Undo. Native Properties hide [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]only when the sheet shows every key and bob can write.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]7[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]record_card.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/record_card.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-ms[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-ms/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Per-record read and record fingerprint in bob records show[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]record-read[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]record-read: add an optional STEM to bob records show that returns one [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]record's typed properties with source lines, identity and other keys, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]findings, full ranked suggestions, and a semantic record fingerprint, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]read-only, with human and JSON output and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Guarded JSON envelope for bob records update[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]record-envelope[dim] · [dim][/dim]after record-read[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]record-envelope: add bob records update -i FILE, a guarded envelope of [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]typed field.set/field.unset ops with an expect fingerprint, inverse ops,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]group consequence, and typed refusals (stale_record repaints in one [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]call), plus an albums list capability flag, docs, tests, and just [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]install.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Read-only record sheet under the H1 (Live Preview and Reading)[bold white on #D75F87][/bold #D7AFFF] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]record-sheet[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]record-sheet: render the record sheet after the first H1 of canonical [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]album records from metadataCache and the cached album report (no [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]subprocess on open), covering values by kind, lint, ghost chips, a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]read-only fold, a created footer, collapse, subscription docking, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]light/dark/375px, and a tested hide gate that is not yet applied.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Record update service and guarded session with direct apply[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]record-session[dim] · [dim][/dim]after record-sheet, record-envelope[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]record-session: plugin service for records show/update, a record session[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]over the shared guarded session with an opt-in direct-apply path, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]inverse-op Undo, pane saves, auto-sync echo suppression, an optimistic [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sheet overlay, and a real-bob writer matrix.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Record Card shell, browse keys, choices, and discrete actions[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]record-card[dim] · [dim][/dim]after record-session[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]record-card: keyboard-first Record Card modal in the Task Card / Schema [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Card idiom with browse navigation, the choices pick list, digits, t, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Ctrl+D, Undo, the YAML excursion, = to the album Schema Card, the status[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rule, hint strip, All actions menu, and live region.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Typed Record Card stages and Tab fill-out[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]record-stages[dim] · [dim][/dim]after record-card[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]record-stages: text, suggest combobox, date, number, URL, link, and list[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stages with debounced bob previews, a latched Enter, Tab and Shift+Tab [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]save-and-advance, and taught refusals for required, invalid, and stale [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]edits.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Entry points, == on records, and the Properties hide[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]record-entry[dim] · [dim][/dim]after record-stages[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]record-entry: wire the sheet's Edit, row, chip, ghost, and missing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]affordances; == on records; the edit-record palette command; [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Ctrl+Shift+P in navigation hotkeys; the Command Mode row; and switch on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the fail-open Properties hide (and the inline-title decision).[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-ms","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_na